<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the German first division after the weekend's matches:</p>
<p>18 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart), Ulf Kirsten</p>
<p>(Bayer Leverkusen)</p>
<p>17 - Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Giovane Elber</p>
<p>(VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>16 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>15 - Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen)</p>
<p>14 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Toni Polster</p>
<p>(Cologne)</p>
<p>13 - Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock), Krasimir</p>
<p>Balakov (VfB Stuttgart), Juergen Klinsmann</p>
<p>(Bayern Munich).</p>
</text>
